cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Trust-control simulation for seller AI copilots"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible synthetic simulation of the deterministic trust controls
  described in "Trustworthy AI Copilots for E-Commerce Sellers: A
  Practitioner's Playbook for Engineering Financial Trust on Managed Payment
  Platforms." Validates settlement reconciliation, cohort-aware return-fraud
  baselines, and inline cross-agent boundary verification on fully synthetic
  data. No language model executes in this code.
